 zjggzy_02\">\n<div class=\"zjggzy_03\">\n<object data=\"https://ggzy.zhanjiang.gov.cn:8097/upload/pdf2html/2c95348b9f16b5ac019f359cfcd72cbepbbg_files/img_02.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" class=\"zjggzy_04\" style=\"position:absolute; width:70.0833em; height:49.5833em;\">\n<embed src=\"https://ggzy.zhanjiang.gov.cn:8097/upload/pdf2html/2c95348b9f16b5ac019f359cfcd72cbepbbg_files/img_02.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" />\n</object>\n</div>\n<div class=\"zjggzy_view\">\n<div class=\"zjggzy_05 zjggzy_06\">\n<div class=\"zjggzy_01\" style=\"left:12.5342em;top:10.402em;\"><span class=\"zjggzy_21 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_09\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">企</span><span class=\"zjggzy_22 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">业</span><span class=\"zjggzy_21 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_09\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">名称 &nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"zjggzy_01\" style=\"left:3.4929em;top:10.4752em;\"><span class=\"zjggzy_21 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_09\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">序号 &nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"zjggzy_01\" style=\"left:29.2283em;top:10.4752em;\"><span class=\"zjggzy_21 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_09\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">原因 &nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"zjggzy_01\" style=\"left:23.9208em;top:12.8044em;\"><span class=\"zjggzy_28 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">投</span><span class=\"zjggzy_29 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">标</span><span class=\"zjggzy_28 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">文件《基本</span><span class=\"zjggzy_29 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">账户</span><span class=\"zjggzy_28 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">信息》无任何 &nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"zjggzy_01\" style=\"left:23.9208em;top:14.1044em;\"><span class=\"zjggzy_29 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">银</span><span class=\"zjggzy_28 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">行相关印章，无法判断</span><span class=\"zjggzy_29 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">为</span><span class=\"zjggzy_28 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">基本</span><span class=\"zjggzy_29 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">账 &nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"zjggzy_01\" style=\"left:23.7125em;top:15.4044em;\"><span class=\"zjggzy_29 zjggzy_08 zjggzy_13\">户</span><span